78
00:05:54,199 --> 00:05:55,300
Give it here, let me look.

79
00:06:00,180 --> 00:06:02,079
Posting so much.

80
00:06:02,339 --> 00:06:03,740
Every single day.

81
00:06:04,740 --> 00:06:06,680
Every single hour.

82
00:06:06,879 --> 00:06:07,819
I didn't block you.

83
00:06:07,839 --> 00:06:09,120
